Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zip, unzip, libqdataschema (= ${binary:Version}), libqt6sql6-sqlite, libqt6sql6-mysql, libqt6sql6-psql
Description: Ananas automation accounting system (runtime and schemes)
 Runtime environment and development platform of the Ananas accounting
 system. Ships the Ananas engine, the administrator tool, the designer and
 the inventory scheme (internal SQLite database), selectable at startup.
Description-ru:  Среда разработки и исполнения прикладных решений автоматизации оперативного, бухгалтерского и других видов учета.
 Учет товаров и рассчетов на компьютере.

Package: libqdataschema
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt Data Schema library
 Provides database schema verification and synchronisation driven by metadata.
 Supports MySQL, PostgreSQL and SQLite. Ships the shared library, its headers
 and the qdsadm command line tool.
Description-ru:  Библиотека для управления схемами баз данных на основе метаданных.
 Поддерживает MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite.
